	'pg_flavours_t' => 'Daily Flavours',
	'pg_flavours_lede' => 'Six standing flavours are churned fresh each open day at our Quay Lane counter. Alongside this core standing list, we introduce seasonal fruit combinations as harvests arrive.',
	'pg_flavours_h1' => 'Burnt Fig & Plum',
	'pg_flavours_p1' => 'Fig roasted until it splits, folded through a plum sorbet ripple. The figs are roasted slowly until the skins caramelize and burst, then rippled through a tart plum sorbet. Sweetness is balanced at three out of five dots, with a dense, smooth texture that holds firmly on the spoon. Served in a single cup for €4.20, a double cup for €5.60, or packed into a 500 ml walk-home tub for €12.00.',
	'pg_flavours_h2' => 'Black Sesame Milk',
	'pg_flavours_p2' => 'Toasted black sesame seeds are finely ground and steeped into fresh whole milk to create this savoury, aromatic gelato. The flavour offers a nutty warmth with faint charcoal notes and mild sweetness rated two out of five dots. The texture is dense and velvety. Available in single cups for €4.20, double cups for €5.60, or a 500 ml tub for €12.00.',
	'pg_flavours_h3' => 'Pear & Bay Leaf',
	'pg_flavours_p3' => 'Ripe pears are gently poached and paired with fragrant dried bay leaves steeped overnight in the milk base. This herbal combination produces an elegant, refreshing scoop with a subtle aromatic finish. Sweetness is rated two out of five dots, and the texture is exceptionally smooth and light. Order as a single cup for €4.20, double cup for €5.60, or a 500 ml tub for €12.00.',
	'pg_flavours_h4' => 'Hazelnut Gianduja',
	'pg_flavours_p4' => 'Finely roasted hazelnuts are blended with rich cocoa to create a classic gianduja paste, churned into a luxurious cream base. It delivers a deeply toasted nuttiness balanced by bittersweet chocolate notes. Sweetness is four out of five dots, and the texture is thick, dense, and glossy. Enjoy in a single cup for €4.20, a double cup for €5.60, or a 500 ml tub for €12.00.',
	'pg_flavours_h5' => 'Lemon Ricotta',
	'pg_flavours_p5' => 'Fresh whole-milk ricotta is whisked with cold lemon zest and fresh citrus juice for a bright, creamy profile reminiscent of baked ricotta cake. The acidity balances the natural sweetness of the curds, scoring two out of five dots for sweetness, with a pillowy, tender texture. Served in a single cup for €4.20, a double cup for €5.60, or a 500 ml tub for €12.00.',
	'pg_flavours_h6' => 'Dark Cocoa Sorbet (vegan)',
	'pg_flavours_p6' => 'Made without dairy, this sorbet relies on pure dark cocoa, spring water, and unrefined sugar to deliver an uncompromising chocolate intensity. Deeply bitter with earthy roasted notes, its sweetness is low at two out of five dots, yet its texture remains remarkably dense, creamy, and dark. Served in a single cup for €4.20, a double cup for €5.60, or a 500 ml tub for €12.00.',
	'pg_flavours_h7' => 'Rotating seasonal batches and allergen guidance',
	'pg_flavours_p7' => 'In addition to our six standing flavours, we churn a single rotating batch when exceptional seasonal fruit arrives at the harbour market. Because all six standing flavours and rotating specials are prepared in our small Quay Lane workshop, trace allergens may be present across batches. We regularly process milk, tree nuts, and sesame. If you have severe allergies or specific dietary requirements, please speak with Mei Han or our counter team before ordering.',
