	'pg_tubs_t' => 'Tubs & Set-Aside',
	'pg_tubs_lede' => 'Pack our daily churns for the walk home or reserve your favourite flavours ahead of time. Our insulated tubs keep gelato cold and dense between our counter and your freezer.',
	'pg_tubs_h1' => 'The tub sizes and packaging',
	'pg_tubs_p1' => 'We pack gelato into two dedicated container sizes, sealed with airtight lids to protect delicate texture during transit. The 500 ml walk-home tub costs €12.00, serves two to three people, and holds up to two flavours. The 1 L family tub costs €21.00, serves four to six people, and holds up to three flavours. For longer walks or warm afternoons, our reusable insulated carry bag is available for €3.00, keeping containers cold on the journey home.',
	'pg_tubs_h2' => 'Complete price list',
	'pg_tubs_p2' => 'Our full counter and takeaway pricing is transparent and fixed across all open days. A single cup with one flavour is €4.20; a double cup with two flavours is €5.60; and an affogato poured over fresh espresso is €6.20. For takeaway, the 500 ml walk-home tub is €12.00, the 1 L family tub is €21.00, and our reusable insulated carry bag is €3.00. All prices include local tax and standard compostable wooden spoons upon request.',
	'pg_tubs_h3' => 'How to reserve a tub for collection',
	'pg_tubs_p3' => 'To ensure your preferred flavour is waiting for you, reserve your tub before 15:00 on any open day from Wednesday through Sunday. Once your request arrives, we pack your tub directly from the morning churns and transfer it to our −18 °C hold shelf. Your order is held for up to 3 hours from your nominated pickup time. When you arrive at 14 Quay Lane, simply give your name to Rafael Moreno or Mei Han to collect.',
	'pg_tubs_h4' => 'When can I collect my reserved tub?',
	'pg_tubs_p4' => 'You may collect your reserved tub anytime between 12:00 and 21:00 on the day of reservation, provided you arrive within 3 hours of your designated pickup window. Because our hold shelf is strictly regulated at −18 °C, tubs maintain their ideal structure while stored. If you need to adjust your collection time or cancel a reservation, please email hello@himurogelato.example before 15:00 so our team can update the hold shelf logs.',
